        "gap": "data/record-clearing/legal-design-packet-set-manifests.json declares five components for ms-nonconv-set and none of them is the specification's required order-1 cover_and_contents document, so product-wiring.json maps it to manifestComponentIds []. This build renders the document as the composed component cover_and_contents and does not edit the manifest, the specification or any legal-design record. Giving the document a manifest component id is owed to the productization lane.",
